{"id":"1a1196fd5e373b39","group":"72","path":"72/72-lem-davis-putnam-projection.md","title":"消元的赋值延拓性质","display":"lem-davis-putnam-projection — 消元的赋值延拓性质","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-lem-davis-putnam-projection","aliases":["72-lem-davis-putnam-projection"],"display":"lem-davis-putnam-projection — 消元的赋值延拓性质","depends_on":["[[72-df-davis-putnam-elimination]]","[[72-df-clause-semantics]]","[[72-thm-resolution-soundness]]"],"chapter":"I","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I proof of Theorem1.3.4, print20–21/PDF32–33; full assignment argument supplied","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revised":"2026-10-22"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-lem-davis-putnam-projection"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-lem-davis-putnam-projection</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-davis-putnam-projection — 消元的赋值延拓性质"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4e6ae3cc72e7164b\" href=\"?note=4e6ae3cc72e7164b\" title=\"72-df-davis-putnam-elimination\">72-df-davis-putnam-elimination</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a7ea013f9a55dcda\" href=\"?note=a7ea013f9a55dcda\" title=\"72-df-clause-semantics\">72-df-clause-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"21921243c3156e00\" href=\"?note=21921243c3156e00\" title=\"72-thm-resolution-soundness\">72-thm-resolution-soundness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"I"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I proof of Theorem1.3.4, print20–21/PDF32–33; full assignment argument supplied"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-22"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,p,\\operatorname{DP}_p\">\\(F,p,\\operatorname{DP}_p\\)</span> 同 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4e6ae3cc72e7164b\" href=\"?note=4e6ae3cc72e7164b\" title=\"72-df-davis-putnam-elimination\">72-df-davis-putnam-elimination</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathsf{Asn}\">\\(a\\in\\mathsf{Asn}\\)</span>；子句和CNF满足关系取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a7ea013f9a55dcda\" href=\"?note=a7ea013f9a55dcda\" title=\"72-df-clause-semantics\">72-df-clause-semantics</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a[p\\mapsto\\varepsilon]:=(a\\restriction(\\mathsf{PV}\\setminus\\{p\\}))\\cup\\{\\langle p,\\varepsilon\\rangle\\}\">\\(a[p\\mapsto\\varepsilon]:=(a\\restriction(\\mathsf{PV}\\setminus\\{p\\}))\\cup\\{\\langle p,\\varepsilon\\rangle\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon\\in\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\varepsilon\\in\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\models_{\\rm cnf}\\operatorname{DP}_p(F)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\{0,1\\}\\ (a[p\\mapsto\\varepsilon]\\models_{\\rm cnf}F).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\models_{\\rm cnf}\\operatorname{DP}_p(F)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\{0,1\\}\\ (a[p\\mapsto\\varepsilon]\\models_{\\rm cnf}F).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Unsat}(F)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{Unsat}(\\operatorname{DP}_p(F)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Unsat}(F)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{Unsat}(\\operatorname{DP}_p(F)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>向左：任何满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 的赋值满足未消元的中性子句和所有归结子句；这些子句不含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>，改回其坐标不影响真值。向右：若某个正父子句除 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 之外全假，则必须取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon=1\">\\(\\varepsilon=1\\)</span>；若某个负父子句除 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg p\">\\(\\neg p\\)</span> 之外全假，则必须取0。两种强迫不能同时发生，否则这两个父子句的归结子句在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 下为假，违背左侧。若没有强迫任选0。被清理的重言子句对每个赋值为真，故也被满足。对赋值存在性取否定得不可满足性的等价；空子句仍会保留，不会被误删。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-davis-putnam-elimination","status":"resolved","id":"4e6ae3cc72e7164b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-davis-putnam-elimination]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-clause-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"a7ea013f9a55dcda","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-clause-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-resolution-soundness","status":"resolved","id":"21921243c3156e00","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-resolution-soundness]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-davis-putnam-elimination","status":"resolved","id":"4e6ae3cc72e7164b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$F,p,\\operatorname{DP}_p$ 同 [[72-df-davis-putnam-elimination]]，$a\\in\\mathsf{Asn}$；子句和CNF满足关系取 [[72-df-clause-semantics]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-clause-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"a7ea013f9a55dcda","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$F,p,\\operatorname{DP}_p$ 同 [[72-df-davis-putnam-elimination]]，$a\\in\\mathsf{Asn}$；子句和CNF满足关系取 [[72-df-clause-semantics]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"F,p,\\operatorname{DP}_p","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\mathsf{Asn}","display":false},{"tex":"a[p\\mapsto\\varepsilon]:=(a\\restriction(\\mathsf{PV}\\setminus\\{p\\}))\\cup\\{\\langle p,\\varepsilon\\rangle\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon\\in\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"a\\models_{\\rm cnf}\\operatorname{DP}_p(F)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\{0,1\\}\\ (a[p\\mapsto\\varepsilon]\\models_{\\rm cnf}F).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Unsat}(F)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{Unsat}(\\operatorname{DP}_p(F)).","display":true},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon=1","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg p","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false}],"bytes":1999,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-461","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-lem-davis-putnam-projection|lem-davis-putnam-projection — 消元的赋值延拓性质]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-436","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-lem-davis-putnam-projection]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-191","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-lem-davis-putnam-projection|lem-davis-putnam-projection — 消元的赋值延拓性质]]"},{"id":"44d3a4bd8308f551","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"29de2a641cb